= extend('/layout')

= content('title', 'append')
  title Education &middot; Nitrous

.hero.main.centered
  .container
    h2 Nitrous and Education
    h4.subtitle Students start coding faster than ever. Zero setup, work from any browser.

    a.btn.btn-lg.btn-default href="/app/#/signup"
      | Get Started for Free

.hero.featurette
  .container
    h2 Manage course material in one beautiful dashboard.
    h4.subtitle
      | Nitrous lets you create, administer, share, and snapshot your school's development projects from one convenient and beautiful dashboard.
    img.feature.full.img-responsive src="/images/dashboard-next-education.png"

.hero.featurette.dual.peakaboo
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-5
        h2 Org member Administration
        h4.subtitle
          | Quickly add and remove team members, and set their role within the organization.
      .col-xs-12.col-md-7
        .full-visual
          img.feature.img-responsive src="/images/members-next-education.png" width="970px"

.hero.featurette.dual.peakaboo
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-5
        h2 Snapshots
        h4.subtitle
          | Preserve the state of your project's environment, and revert back to them at any time
      .col-xs-12.col-md-7
        .full-visual
          img.feature.img-responsive src="/images/members-next-education.png" width="970px"

article.blockquote.tealeaf
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-8.col-md-offset-2
        blockquote
          img.blockquote-image src="/images/customers/tealeaf.svg" alt="tealeaf logo"
          . Nitrous has
          span.highlight saved us a lot of time
          . , because its one-click development environment allows our students to
          span.highlight focus on the most important thing: learning to code.
          |  Nitrous is all that you need as a developer and nothing more. In other words, when our students use Nitrous, they're learning how to work like a real developer, not learning a proprietary product. The Nitrous development environment is just Unix, and a code editor - that's how real programmers work. We love that about Nitrous.

          .author
            | Chris Lee,
            span.bio Co-founder of Tealeaf Academy

article.blockquote.pilot
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-8.col-md-offset-2
        blockquote
          img.blockquote-image src="/images/customers/pilot.png" alt="pilot logo"
          . We love the
          span.highlight easy-to-use coding interface
          .  and the
          span.highlight amazing collaborative technology
          .  that Nitrous offers. In the past, we used other code sharing software such as Git and Dropbox, but the live code collaboration Nitrous provides is just awesome. Nitrous definitely increased our productivity a great deal, especially in an overnight event where fatigue catches up with your body and tempers rise quickly if software doesn't cooperate.

          .author
            | Michael Reininger,
            span.bio part of the PilotDC hackathon's winning team from Montgomery High
